//! sigGen case (internal interface, deterministic) — exact tgId/tcId in
//! each struct's doc comment. SLH-DSA-SHA2-128f additionally carries a
//! pure external deterministic case with a 110-byte context and a hedged
//! internal case (explicit additionalRandomness).

